{"seq":2,"slug":"self-serve-platform","title":"自服务数据平台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture/self-serve-platform","wordCount":1110,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自服务数据平台设计\">自服务数据平台设计</h1><p>自服务数据基础设施平台（Self-Serve Data Infrastructure Platform）是数据网格的技术支柱。它将平台团队的职责从&quot;直接服务每个领域的数据需求&quot;转变为&quot;构建领域团队能够自助使用的基础设施能力&quot;。本文讲解如何设计这个平台。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台即产品思维\">平台即产品思维</h2><p>平台团队不再是执行每个领域数据请求的服务者，而是为领域团队提供<strong>数据产品开发工具链</strong>的产品团队。这需要平台团队：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将领域团队视为<strong>内部客户</strong>，关注其开发体验</li>\n<li>提供自助服务能力，而非按需定制</li>\n<li>像产品团队一样收集反馈、迭代改进</li>\n<li>测量平台采用率和领域团队生产力作为 KPI</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"平台能力框架\">平台能力框架</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"自服务数据平台能力层&#10;&#10;┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│ 开发体验层 (Developer Experience)                       │&#10;│  数据产品脚手架 / 本地开发环境 / 文档与示例              │&#10;├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│ 数据产品生命周期层 (Data Product Lifecycle)              │&#10;│  构建 / 测试 / 部署 / 版本管理 / 退役                   │&#10;├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│ 运行时基础设施层 (Runtime Infrastructure)               │&#10;│  存储 / 计算 / 流处理 / 查询引擎                        │&#10;├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│ 治理与可观测层 (Governance &amp; Observability)             │&#10;│  Schema Registry / 数据目录 / 质量监控 / 血缘追踪        │&#10;├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│ 安全与访问层 (Security &amp; Access Control)                │&#10;│  RBAC / 数据分级 / 审计日志 / 加密                      │&#10;└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>自服务数据平台能力层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ 开发体验层 (Developer Experience)                       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  数据产品脚手架 / 本地开发环境 / 文档与示例              │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ 数据产品生命周期层 (Data Product Lifecycle)              │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  构建 / 测试 / 部署 / 版本管理 / 退役                   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ 运行时基础设施层 (Runtime Infrastructure)               │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  存储 / 计算 / 流处理 / 查询引擎                        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ 治理与可观测层 (Governance &#x26; Observability)             │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  Schema Registry / 数据目录 / 质量监控 / 血缘追踪        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ 安全与访问层 (Security &#x26; Access Control)                │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  RBAC / 数据分级 / 审计日志 / 加密                      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"核心平台能力设计\">核心平台能力设计</h2><h3 id=\"数据产品模板-data-product-template\">数据产品模板（Data Product Template）</h3><p>平台团队提供可复用的数据产品模板，让领域团队无需从头搭建基础设施：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"data-product-template/&#10;├── spec.yaml.template           # 数据产品规格模板&#10;├── Makefile                     # 标准化构建命令&#10;├── pipelines/&#10;│   ├── kafka-to-bigquery/       # Kafka 流→BigQuery 批量快照模板&#10;│   ├── cdc-to-kafka/            # CDC→Kafka 实时流模板&#10;│   └── api-to-batch/            # API 轮询→批量存储模板&#10;├── quality/&#10;│   ├── rules.soda.yaml.template # Soda 质量规则模板&#10;│   └── expectations.json.template # Great Expectations 模板&#10;├── catalog/&#10;│   └── metadata.yaml.template   # 数据目录注册元数据模板&#10;└── cicd/&#10;    └── .github/workflows/&#10;        ├── validate.yaml        # 规格验证 CI&#10;        └── deploy.yaml          # 部署 CD\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data-product-template/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── spec.yaml.template           # 数据产品规格模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Makefile                     # 标准化构建命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── pipelines/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── kafka-to-bigquery/       # Kafka 流→BigQuery 批量快照模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── cdc-to-kafka/            # CDC→Kafka 实时流模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api-to-batch/            # API 轮询→批量存储模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── quality/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── rules.soda.yaml.template # Soda 质量规则模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── expectations.json.template # Great Expectations 模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── catalog/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── metadata.yaml.template   # 数据目录注册元数据模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── cicd/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── .github/workflows/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── validate.yaml        # 规格验证 CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── deploy.yaml          # 部署 CD</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 平台提供的 CLI 工具&#10;dp init --template cdc-to-kafka \\&#10;        --domain order \\&#10;        --name order-events \\&#10;        --owner order-platform-team&#10;&#10;# 初始化后得到完整数据产品项目骨架&#10;# 领域团队只需填充业务逻辑\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 平台提供的 CLI 工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --template</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cdc-to-kafka</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --domain</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> order-events</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        --owner</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> order-platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初始化后得到完整数据产品项目骨架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 领域团队只需填充业务逻辑</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"计算和存储基础设施模板\">计算和存储基础设施模板</h3><p>平台提供预配置的计算和存储资源模板，领域团队通过声明式 YAML 申请：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# infrastructure/order-events-infra.yaml&#10;apiVersion: data-platform/v1&#10;kind: DataProductInfrastructure&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-events&#10;  domain: order&#10;&#10;compute:&#10;  streaming:&#10;    engine: apache-flink&#10;    parallelism: 4&#10;    stateBackend: rocksdb&#10;    checkpointInterval: &#39;PT5M&#39;&#10;    resources:&#10;      cpu: &#39;4&#39;&#10;      memory: &#39;8Gi&#39;&#10;&#10;storage:&#10;  hot:&#10;    type: kafka&#10;    partitions: 12&#10;    replicationFactor: 3&#10;    retentionMs: 604800000 # 7 days&#10;&#10;  cold:&#10;    type: bigquery&#10;    dataset: &#39;order_domain&#39;&#10;    table: &#39;order_events_v2&#39;&#10;    partitioning:&#10;      type: DAY&#10;      field: event_date&#10;    clustering:&#10;      fields: [&#39;domain&#39;, &#39;event_type&#39;]&#10;&#10;networking:&#10;  ingressAllowList:&#10;    - &#39;payment-domain&#39;&#10;    - &#39;analytics-platform&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># infrastructure/order-events-infra.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">data-platform/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DataProductInfrastructure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  domain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  streaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    engine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apache-flink</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    parallelism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    stateBackend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">rocksdb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    checkpointInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PT5M'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8Gi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    partitions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    replicationFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    retentionMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">604800000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 7 days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bigquery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dataset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_domain'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_events_v2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    partitioning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DAY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">event_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    clustering</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      fields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'domain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'event_type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">networking</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingressAllowList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment-domain'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'analytics-platform'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Terraform 模块或 Crossplane Composition 可以将这个声明转换为实际的云资源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"backstage-作为数据平台门户\">Backstage 作为数据平台门户</h3><p>Backstage（Spotify 开源的内部开发者门户）可以扩展为数据产品平台的统一入口：</p>\n<p><strong>数据产品注册插件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>展示所有数据产品的目录</li>\n<li>每个数据产品显示 schema、SLO、血缘图、质量状态</li>\n<li>与 DataHub/Amundsen 集成，保持元数据同步</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据产品脚手架模板</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backstage Software Templates 支持交互式的数据产品创建向导</li>\n<li>通过 Web UI 填写参数，自动生成并提交 PR</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自助服务工作流</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>申请数据产品访问权限（自动触发审批流）</li>\n<li>查看当前已申请的数据产品 SLO 状态</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Backstage 数据产品 Template 定义（简化）&#10;apiVersion: scaffolder.backstage.io/v1beta3&#10;kind: Template&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: data-product-template&#10;  title: &#39;创建新数据产品&#39;&#10;spec:&#10;  parameters:&#10;    - title: &#39;数据产品基本信息&#39;&#10;      properties:&#10;        domain:&#10;          title: &#39;所属领域&#39;&#10;          type: string&#10;          enum: [&#39;order&#39;, &#39;user&#39;, &#39;payment&#39;, &#39;catalog&#39;]&#10;        name:&#10;          title: &#39;数据产品名称（kebab-case）&#39;&#10;          type: string&#10;        outputType:&#10;          title: &#39;主要输出类型&#39;&#10;          enum: [&#39;kafka-stream&#39;, &#39;bigquery-table&#39;, &#39;rest-api&#39;]&#10;&#10;  steps:&#10;    - action: fetch:template&#10;      input:&#10;        url: ./skeleton&#10;        values:&#10;          domain: ${{ parameters.domain }}&#10;          name: ${{ parameters.name }}&#10;    - action: publish:github&#10;      input:&#10;        repoUrl: &#39;github.com/company/data-products&#39;&#10;    - action: catalog:register&#10;      input:&#10;        catalogInfoUrl: &#39;https://github.com/company/data-products/.../catalog-info.yaml&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style